OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWoman on chemotherapy ineligible
OL,4,Afor cancer drug
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother-of-five living with incurable
OL,7,Fsecondary breast cancer, which has
OL,8,Fspread to her liver and bones, has been
OL,9,Ftold she cannot receive a drug that
OL,10,Fmight prolong her life as she is on her
OL,11,Fthird round of chemotherapy.
OL,13,FNHS England has access to Enhertu, but
OL,14,Fonly for patients who have had one or
OL,15,Ftwo previous lines of chemotherapy.
OL,17,FLaura Stanford, from Minster on the
OL,18,FIsle of Sheppey in Kent, who recently
OL,19,Fbecame a grandmother and has a daughter
OL,20,Fwho is due to get married this
OL,21,FDecember, said she cannot afford to get
OL,22,Fthe drug privately.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
