OL,3,GNEWSAWoman on chemotherapy ineligible
OL,4,Afor cancer drug
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for NHS England said:
OL,7,F"We recognise how important access to
OL,8,FEnhertu is for people living with
OL,9,Fsecondary breast cancer and their
OL,10,Ffamilies."
